# Demo recordings: what gets published is committed, what a take produces on
# the way there is not. torio-demo.mp4 is the preview copy vhs emits beside the
# committed GIF of the same thing; hub-raw.mp4 is the take before its waiting is
# fast-forwarded into docs/demo/hub.mp4 and hub.gif.
docs/demo/torio-demo.mp4
docs/demo/hub-raw.mp4

# Screenshot tape: the frames it captures are committed, the animation is not.
# vhs requires an Output line, so the recording exists as a by-product and
# nothing reads it.
docs/demo/screens/screens.gif
